   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Shariq has avoided making an appointment at the college career center and has changed his major four times in his first year. When asked whether he likes his current major, he says, “Sure, but if something better comes along, I’ll switch.” According to James Marcia, at which identity stage is he?",
